{"id":"wb-3-169","name":"老君岩造像","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"清源山石造像","text":"清源山石造像是中国福建省泉州市丰泽区清源山上的7处9尊宋元时期的石雕造像，包括老君岩、瑞像岩、赐恩岩、弥陀岩、碧霄岩、西峰岩、千手岩，既有道教造像，也有佛教（含藏传佛教）造像，其雕工精湛，极富历史和艺术价值。\n老君岩是中国现存最大的宋代道教石像，也是清源山的标志性景点，于1988年列为中国第三批全国重点文物保护单位。2001年公布第五批全国重点文物保护单位时，将另外6处8尊石造像与老君岩造像合并保护，称为“清源山石造像群”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B8%85%E6%BA%90%E5%B1%B1%E7%9F%B3%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F","revisionId":86558516,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86558516","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9daf5c7b5687ebd7e534ed5d.jpg","title":"Statue_of_Lao_Tzu_in_Quanzhou.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Statue_of_Lao_Tzu_in_Quanzhou.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/Statue_of_Lao_Tzu_in_Quanzhou.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Tom@HK","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","caption":"​福建泉州老君岩","width":320,"height":213}}